hifiberry-songcompare (1.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Debian packaging for the 1.0.0 release. Builds the release binary and
    installs it as /usr/bin/songcompare; the package is named
    hifiberry-songcompare to match the rest of the HiFiBerry OS repository.
  * The unit tests run as part of the package build, so a broken build is
    caught where the .deb is made rather than only in CI.

 -- HiFiBerry <info@hifiberry.com>  Wed, 02 Sep 2026 08:05:17 +0000
